WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.734 --> 00:00:18.418
"I'll be leading the ride," Ms. Hernandez said.

2
00:00:18.419 --> 00:00:23.263
"Remember, this isn't a race. Everyone who finishes gets a prize."

3
00:00:23.264 --> 00:00:27.160
"Even if it takes me until tomorrow?" Cole called out.

4
00:00:27.161 --> 00:00:31.021
Lots of people laughed, including Ms. Hernandez.

5
00:00:31.022 --> 00:00:35.631
"Even then," she said. "Let's get on the trail!"

6
00:00:35.632 --> 00:00:40.246
"Go, Belltown!" a blond girl cried.

7
00:00:40.247 --> 00:00:42.320
Henry recognized the girl.

8
00:00:42.321 --> 00:00:46.575
Her name was Melanie, and she was a cheerleader at Belltown High.

9
00:00:46.576 --> 00:00:49.714
Today Melanie wasn't the only person cheering.

10
00:00:49.715 --> 00:00:56.873
Almost everyone let out a whoop as the bikers started down the trail.

11
00:00:56.874 --> 00:01:05.354
Henry was trying to keep up with Cole and Maggie through some pine trees when a shiny mountain bike rushed in front of him.

12
00:01:05.355 --> 00:01:08.049
"Whoa!" Henry cried.

13
00:01:08.050 --> 00:01:12.704
He braked just in time to keep from crashing into the other bike.

14
00:01:12.705 --> 00:01:14.992
The rider was about his age.

15
00:01:14.993 --> 00:01:21.046
"Sorry," the boy muttered, glancing back at Henry. Then he rode ahead quickly.

16
00:01:21.047 --> 00:01:23.805
Henry's friends had heard Henry cry out.

17
00:01:23.806 --> 00:01:27.493
They stopped and turned around to see if he was okay.

18
00:01:27.494 --> 00:01:30.627
"Who was that kid?" Maggie asked.

19
00:01:30.628 --> 00:01:33.358
A girl named Daisy overheard her.

20
00:01:33.359 --> 00:01:38.347
"Are you talking about that boy on the fancy mountain bike?" she asked.

21
00:01:38.348 --> 00:01:42.044
"Yeah," Cole said. "We didn't recognize him."

22
00:01:42.045 --> 00:01:46.711
"He just moved here," Daisy said. "His name is William.

23
00:01:46.712 --> 00:01:51.571
My mom told me his family bought a huge house right outside of town."

24
00:01:51.572 --> 00:01:54.543
"How does she know?" asked Maggie.

25
00:01:54.544 --> 00:01:58.587
"She sells houses for a living," Daisy explained.

26
00:01:58.588 --> 00:02:02.920
A few more riders rode past, including Jill and Ashley.

27
00:02:02.921 --> 00:02:07.741
"Giving up already?" Jill called out to Henry and the others with a grin.

28
00:02:07.742 --> 00:02:14.368
"No way!" Cole called back. "Come on, guys. Let's go!"

29
00:02:14.369 --> 00:02:20.001
He raced off. Henry and Maggie chased after him, laughing.

30
00:02:20.002 --> 00:02:23.497
All three of them kept riding fast for a while.

31
00:02:23.498 --> 00:02:26.561
Then they slowed down to rest their legs.

32
00:02:26.562 --> 00:02:32.048
Lots of other people were riding slowly too, enjoying the pretty scenery.

33
00:02:32.049 --> 00:02:36.955
"This is fun," Maggie said. "I'm glad we came."

34
00:02:36.956 --> 00:02:40.791
"Even though it cost you ten dollars?" Cole teased.

35
00:02:40.792 --> 00:02:43.962
"Maybe more than that," Maggie reminded him.

36
00:02:43.963 --> 00:02:47.007
"With all the lemonade business we lost today!"

37
00:02:47.008 --> 00:02:50.232
Henry laughed, and then looked around.

38
00:02:50.233 --> 00:02:55.420
"Where's Nathan? I haven't seen him since we started riding."

39
00:02:55.421 --> 00:03:00.645
"I think he was behind us," Cole said. "Let's wait for him to catch up."

40
00:03:00.646 --> 00:03:05.542
They stopped their bikes. Lots of other riders passed them.

41
00:03:05.543 --> 00:03:08.930
Most were smiling or chatting with their friends.

42
00:03:08.931 --> 00:03:12.010
Everyone seemed to be having fun.

43
00:03:12.011 --> 00:03:17.542
Then William rode past again. He wasn't smiling or talking to anyone.

44
00:03:17.543 --> 00:03:21.460
"He doesn't look like he's having a good time," Cole whispered.

45
00:03:21.461 --> 00:03:25.700
Henry didn't answer. He'd just spotted Nathan coming.

46
00:03:25.701 --> 00:03:27.678
He wasn't smiling either.

47
00:03:27.679 --> 00:03:32.094
The teenage boy in the Valley High shirt was riding alongside him.

48
00:03:32.095 --> 00:03:35.854
"What's the matter?" the older boy teased Nathan.

49
00:03:35.855 --> 00:03:37.800
"Can't you keep up?

50
00:03:37.801 --> 00:03:42.768
Is everyone at Belltown High School as slow and lazy as you?"

51
00:03:42.769 --> 00:03:46.637
Henry could tell that Nathan was trying to ignore the bully.

52
00:03:46.638 --> 00:03:50.394
But just then Nathan bumped into a rock on the trail.

53
00:03:50.395 --> 00:03:56.490
His front tire wobbled, and he had to brake suddenly.

54
00:03:56.491 --> 00:04:00.182
"Looks like you're quitting," the bully said with a smirk.

55
00:04:00.183 --> 00:04:03.324
"I guess that makes you a Belltown quitter!"

56
00:04:03.325 --> 00:04:07.053
"Hey!" Cole said. "Leave him alone!"

57
00:04:07.054 --> 00:04:10.126
Just then three other riders caught up to them.

58
00:04:10.127 --> 00:04:12.961
They all went to Belltown High School.

59
00:04:12.962 --> 00:04:17.549
One was Henry's neighbor, Tiny, the tallest kid in tenth grade.

60
00:04:17.550 --> 00:04:20.673
"What's going on?" Tiny asked.

61
00:04:20.674 --> 00:04:25.123
"That Valley High kid is bothering Nathan," Maggie said.

62
00:04:25.124 --> 00:04:30.684
The bully heard her and scowled. "I was just joking around," he muttered.

63
00:04:30.685 --> 00:04:33.128
One of Tiny's friends laughed.

64
00:04:33.129 --> 00:04:37.845
"That makes sense, since Valley High's sports teams are all a big joke."

65
00:04:37.846 --> 00:04:43.338
"They are not!" the bully retorted angrily. "Yours are!"

66
00:04:43.339 --> 00:04:54.220
He sped away, still scowling. The others shrugged and continued the ride.

67
00:04:54.221 --> 00:05:02.205
The trail wound through the woods, up and down hills, and past wildflower meadows.

68
00:05:02.206 --> 00:05:07.353
Finally it widened into a big field.

69
00:05:07.354 --> 00:05:10.895
Many people had already stopped their bikes there.

70
00:05:10.896 --> 00:05:14.184
"This must be the first rest stop," Henry said.

71
00:05:14.185 --> 00:05:17.221
There were two stops planned during the ride.

72
00:05:17.222 --> 00:05:22.731
A local restaurant was providing drinks and snacks for all the riders at each stop.

73
00:05:22.732 --> 00:05:30.506
Henry and the others left their bikes in the field and walked up a narrow hiking trail.

74
00:05:30.507 --> 00:05:38.437
It took about five minutes to reach a picnic area near the river.

75
00:05:38.438 --> 00:05:43.621
For the next half hour, everyone rested and enjoyed the snacks and the view.

76
00:05:43.622 --> 00:05:50.786
Henry sat with Cole, Maggie, Nathan, and some other friends.

77
00:05:50.787 --> 00:05:56.617
He noticed William sitting by himself and wondered if he should invite William to sit with them.

78
00:05:56.618 --> 00:06:03.531
Before Henry could decide, William got up and wandered away.

79
00:06:03.532 --> 00:06:09.900
Finally Ms. Hernandez announced that it was time to continue the ride.

80
00:06:09.901 --> 00:06:14.946
But when they got back to the bikes, someone let out a cry of surprise.

81
00:06:14.947 --> 00:06:25.650
"I can't believe this!" Daisy shouted. "Someone slashed our tires!"
